<!doctype html>
<html>
<body style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:#fafafa;color:#0a0a0a;margin:0;padding:24px">
  <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:8px">
    <tr><td style="padding:32px">
      <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#525252">rogerhenley.dev · JD review</p>
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Your review is waiting on the candidate: {{.Headline}}</h1>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5">The review read the posting against Roger's records and has put <strong>{{.Questions}}</strong> follow-up {{if eq .Questions 1}}question{{else}}questions{{end}} to Roger, about {{if eq .Questions 1}}a requirement{{else}}requirements{{end}} the documents on file could not settle.</p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:10px 12px;background:#f5f5f5;border-left:3px solid #0f3d5c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">No fit is given while a question is open, so that the result you get is the one with the answers in it.{{if .Deadline}} The wait has a limit: on <strong>{{.Deadline}}</strong> any question still open is closed unanswered and the fit is issued from what is evidenced.{{end}} You will get the finished review by email either way.</p>

      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:20px">
        <tr>
          <td>
            <a href="{{.ReviewURL}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#0f3d5c;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Open the review as it stands</a>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#737373">Each requirement, its verdict so far and the reason are on the review page.</p>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
